  <NAME>Identify mRNA with m6A modification in PLC-8024 cells [MeRIP-seq]</NAME>
  <TITLE>Identify mRNA with m6A modification in PLC-8024 cells [MeRIP-seq]</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>To investigate the m6A mapping in HCC, we employed MeRIP-seq to identify mRNAs with m6A modification Overall design: m6A immunoprecipitation was performed and the strand-specific libraries were sequenced on Illumina Novaseq 6000 system with paired-end 2×150 bp read length.</DESCRIPTION>
